      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The main potential drawback I can think of is that this feature probably isn't supported on non-meta headsets/platforms (e.g. SteamVR). VRChat's hand tracking works with more than just Meta headsets. VRChat might not want to add a feature that only works on Meta headsets.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
